XR diorama: the HUD replay makes its own EFB copies; the bubble (a sphere) as the mask's shape

- The HUD replay (patch 0026) now resolves its passes: 2D drawn into a texture and then shown (the
  dialogue box's text, full-screen effects) was left empty by the eyes, and the HUD drew it empty or
  with the right eye's picture (a silhouette over the panel).
- aurora_xr_set_diorama_mask's fade has a fourth value: 1 = the bubble, a sphere of radius 1 around the
  table space's origin, fading over fade[0].

